      636.23
    ],
    "text": "An alloment of land is called Kobekatuwehena about0.3284 Hectare in extent depicted as Lot 01, in P.P.K. PlanNumber 3615 and dated 08.10.2018 of preliminary plan madeby the Senior Superintendent of Survey and situated in thevillage of Thambarawa, in the Grama Niladhari Division ofNo. 44A, Habalakkawa, in the Minor Division of GalbataKorale (West), in the Divisional Secretariat Division ofAranayaka, in the Distric of Kagalle, in SabaragamuwaProvince. Boundaries are as follows.",
