      392.64,
      562.05,
      440.15
    ],
    "text": "Other particulars: Land has been acquired under Section38 (A) of the Land Acquisition Act. M.M.K. Dayarathna whois preliminary claimant and resident of No. F 07 Demalahiriya,Aranayaka for the completion of acquistion activities.",
